200c9ed2 [deepseek-v4] #`echo.exe` in that path?). This is cosmetic.
200c9ed2 [deepseek-v4] #
200c9ed2 [deepseek-v4] #5. Missing cross‑platform code – The current `tools.h` only declares functions but provides
200c9ed2 [deepseek-v4] #no implementation. Your build succeeded, so you must have a Windows implementation (likely using
200c9ed3 [deepseek-v4] #`SetupAPI`). If you intend to share or maintain this project, consider providing that
200c9ed3 [deepseek-v4] #implementation (or a portable library like `libserialport`). The `udev.h` file suggests a Linux
