21343e07 [grok-build-0.1] #- songs.json, phrases.json, stories.json, mahjong.md, dither.md, palvideo.txt
21343e07 [grok-build-0.1] #
21343e07 [grok-build-0.1] #Observations
21343e07 [grok-build-0.1] #
21343e08 [grok-build-0.1] #The collection has a consistent "spec bible" flavour — structured JSON where possible, with some
21343e08 [grok-build-0.1] #markdown for visuals or notes. There's clear overlap between the Commodore/VIC-20/C64 files and the
21343e08 [grok-build-0.1] #broader machinespec.json. The biological data (ambulate + bugs + species) feels like a deliberate
21343e08 [grok-build-0.1] #parallel to the hardware specs.
21343e09 [grok-build-0.1] #
