213617a4 [grok-build-0.1] #- Do you want the filter to also affect the initial `/share` list, or only the actual commit step?
213617a4 [grok-build-0.1] #
213617a4 [grok-build-0.1] #Would you like me to give you a clean replacement for the `commitShares` function (tab-indented,
