2136c434 [grok-build-0.1] #for users.
2136c434 [grok-build-0.1] #
2136c435 [grok-build-0.1] #• 3. slopbot.ts*
2136c435 [grok-build-0.1] #- The `openChannel` + `forward` logic is still quite experimental (lots of commented-out paths).
2136c435 [grok-build-0.1] #- Command routing is currently quite restricted (`UserCommands` vs `AllUserCommands`).
2136c435 [grok-build-0.1] #- The bot-to-relay protocol is simple NDJSON, which is good.
2136c436 [grok-build-0.1] #
2136c436 [grok-build-0.1] #• 4. Documentation*
