213f305f [grok-build-0.1] #
213f305f [grok-build-0.1] #- Close the port handle after use.
213f305f [grok-build-0.1] #- Only print ignored ports at a higher verbosity level (or suppress them by default).
213f305f [grok-build-0.1] #- Extract the "send boot command to matching ports" logic into a named function.
213f3060 [grok-build-0.1] #- Consider returning a success/failure count from the sending logic.
