2148092a [grok-build-0.1] #
2148092b [grok-build-0.1] #To help decide on a direction, I’d like to understand your goals:
2148092b [grok-build-0.1] #
2148092b [grok-build-0.1] #1. When a user posts a message in Discord right now, what should happen?
