2148092e [grok-build-0.1] #
2148092e [grok-build-0.1] #4. How important is it that the bots can talk to each other (bot-to-bot communication)?
2148092e [grok-build-0.1] #
2148092f [grok-build-0.1] #5. Would you rather keep the three bots as fully separate processes, or are you open to the relay
2148092f [grok-build-0.1] #having more control over them?
2148092f [grok-build-0.1] #
