214a4174 [grok-build-0.1] #- Paging / virtual memory with LRU linked list
214a4174 [grok-build-0.1] #- Save/restore, verify
214a4174 [grok-build-0.1] #- Extended opcodes for icons (`OPSHOWI`, `OPSHOWN`, `OPSETI`, `OPSWAPI`, `OPITER`, `OPWIND`, etc.)
214a4175 [grok-build-0.1] #- Blockset / icon iteration tables for animated or masked sprites
214a4175 [grok-build-0.1] #- Alternate screen buffer + `md_screen_update` for faster graphics on the target hardware
214a4175 [grok-build-0.1] #- Heavy use of old K&R style, global state, and platform `#ifdef UNIX` sections (tam.h, window.h,
214a4176 [grok-build-0.1] #ioctl, etc.)
214a4176 [grok-build-0.1] #
