215d990f [grok-build-0.1] #extensions (icon graphics, blocksets, masking, iteration tables, clipping windows, etc.).
215d990f [grok-build-0.1] #- Lots of AT&T PC / Unix-specific code (termio, TAM windows, raster ops via ioctl).
215d9910 [grok-build-0.1] #- Extensive comments and edit history going back to the original ZIP work.
215d9910 [grok-build-0.1] #- Debug support, save/restore, verify, and a full graphics pipeline for "icons" (tile-like blocks).
215d9910 [grok-build-0.1] #
215d9910 [grok-build-0.1] #It’s clearly a period piece — very 80s C style with macros, global state, and careful bit-twiddling
215d9911 [grok-build-0.1] #for the graphics layer.
215d9911 [grok-build-0.1] #
