215dc314 [grok-build-0.1] #UNIX systems with AT&T 7300/PC-specific extensions (`tam.h`, windowing, alternate screen buffer for
215dc314 [grok-build-0.1] #block/icon graphics).
215dc314 [grok-build-0.1] #- It implements a full Z-machine (ZIP) with custom DIP opcodes for icons, blocksets, iteration
215dc314 [grok-build-0.1] #tables, clipping, input polling, and masked drawing.
215dc315 [grok-build-0.1] #- Structure is classic: memory paging/LRU, Z-stack, opcode dispatch in `nxtins()`, virtual memory
215dc315 [grok-build-0.1] #helpers (`getpag`, `getbyt`, etc.), and machine-dependent graphics layer.
215dc315 [grok-build-0.1] #- Preload strategy, save/restore, verify checksum, and restart handling are all present.
