215e3142 [grok-build-0.1] #`rdbyts`, `sav_res`, etc.). A simple `#define open fopen` will explode with compile or runtime
215e3142 [grok-build-0.1] #errors.
215e3143 [grok-build-0.1] #
215e3143 [grok-build-0.1] #Recommended approach
215e3143 [grok-build-0.1] #
