2174c99a [glm-5.2] #Now I can see the full picture. Let me trace the bot flow end to end.
2174c99a [glm-5.2] #
2174c99a [glm-5.2] #• Incoming (Discord → Relay):*
2174c99b [glm-5.2] #
2174c99b [glm-5.2] #In `relaybot.ts`, when a Discord user messages, the bot sends:
2174c99b [glm-5.2] #
