218a35c2 [glm-5.2] #The most natural next iteration is to decode the types and flags into human-readable
218a35c2 [glm-5.2] #strings, just like `readelf` does. Right now, your output says `type:0x1` or `type:0x70000001`.
218a35c2 [glm-5.2] #It would be much more readable if it said `type:LOAD` or `type:ARM_EXIDX`.
218a35c3 [glm-5.2] #
