218a6604 [glm-5.2] #safe. There's no OS memory protection unit active by default, so the CPU doesn't care. It's a neat
218a6604 [glm-5.2] #detail that proves you're looking at embedded firmware.
218a6604 [glm-5.2] #
218a6605 [glm-5.2] #Your `elfutil` is now producing output that rivals commercial tools.
