21df29a8 [gpt-5.3-codex] #Given your current `elfutil`, here’s the practical route:
21df29a9 [gpt-5.3-codex] #
21df29a9 [gpt-5.3-codex] #1. Find symbol anchors first
21df29a9 [gpt-5.3-codex] #- In your symbol dump, look for:
21df29a9 [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `main`
21df29aa [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `crc32Memory`
21df29aa [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `crc32Calculate`
21df29aa [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `botTitle`
21df29aa [gpt-5.3-codex] #- If symbols are present (not stripped), note their `st_value` addresses.
21df29ab [gpt-5.3-codex] #Those are your ground truth entry points into `.text` / `.rodata`.
21df29ab [gpt-5.3-codex] #
21df29ab [gpt-5.3-codex] #2. If stripped, use constant signatures
21df29ab [gpt-5.3-codex] #- `crc32Calculate` almost always embeds polynomial:
21df29ac [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `0xEDB88320`
21df29ac [gpt-5.3-codex] #- `crc32Memory` init/final XOR constants:
21df29ac [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `0xFFFFFFFF`
21df29ac [gpt-5.3-codex] #- String literal:
21df29ad [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `"vidbot 0.2.0"`
21df29ad [gpt-5.3-codex] #- In Thumb2 disassembly, constant loads may be via literal pool (`ldr reg, [pc, #imm]`) rather than
21df29ad [gpt-5.3-codex] #immediate mov, so scan nearby pool words too.
21df29ae [gpt-5.3-codex] #
21df29ae [gpt-5.3-codex] #3. Map VMA ↔ file offset correctly
21df29ae [gpt-5.3-codex] #- Your current `.text` dump indexing via `sh_offset - sizeof(elf32)` works only because you stored
21df29ae [gpt-5.3-codex] #“file minus ELF header” in `content`.
21df29af [gpt-5.3-codex] #- For robust binary location, compute using section header directly:
21df29af [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- section file range: `[sh_offset, sh_offset + sh_size)`
21df29af [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- section VMA range: `[sh_addr, sh_addr + sh_size)`
21df29af [gpt-5.3-codex] #- Then convert symbol value to offset with:
21df29b0 [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `file_off = sh_offset + (sym_value - sh_addr)`
21df29b0 [gpt-5.3-codex] #
21df29b0 [gpt-5.3-codex] #4. Expect optimizations to reshape functions
21df29b0 [gpt-5.3-codex] #- At higher optimization:
21df29b1 [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `crc32Calculate` may inline into `crc32Memory`
21df29b1 [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- loops may be tightened/reordered
21df29b1 [gpt-5.3-codex] #	- `botTitle` may be merged/placed in `.rodata` with alignment padding
21df29b1 [gpt-5.3-codex] #- So absence of a standalone function symbol doesn’t mean logic is missing.
21df29b2 [gpt-5.3-codex] #
21df29b2 [gpt-5.3-codex] #5. Your build flags imply minimal runtime scaffolding
21df29b2 [gpt-5.3-codex] #- `-nostartfiles` and pico link setup can make entry/startup layout nonstandard.
