21df7a5b [gpt-5.3-codex] #- If `p_memsz > p_filesz`, that tail is zero-fill at load time (not in file).
21df7a5c [gpt-5.3-codex] #
21df7a5c [gpt-5.3-codex] #One caution: guard `p_offset < sizeof(elf32)` and bounds (`start + p_filesz <= content.size()`)
21df7a5c [gpt-5.3-codex] #before calling `dumpMem`, so malformed ELFs don’t crash your tool.
