2221dccf [deepseek-v4-flash] # ꔀ Relay 1.9.4 deepseek-v4-flash 🐋 🪠 0.7° $0.013 142.7KB 16.81s
2221dccf [deepseek-v4-flash] #You're right – I misunderstood your indexing. I apologize.
2221dcd0 [deepseek-v4-flash] #
2221dcd0 [deepseek-v4-flash] #Looking at your `gridWindow` more carefully:
2221dcd0 [deepseek-v4-flash] #
2221dcd0 [deepseek-v4-flash] #
