222da423 [nitro@ryzen5] types of books about peoples lives
222da47a [deepseek-v4-flash] # ꔀ Relay 1.9.4 deepseek-v4-flash 🐋 🪠 0.7° $0.000 493B 4.93s
222da47a [deepseek-v4-flash] #There are several recognized types of books focusing on people's lives, each distinguished by
222da47a [deepseek-v4-flash] #perspective, scope, and narrative style.
222da47a [deepseek-v4-flash] #
222da47b [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Autobiography – A first‑person account written by the subject themselves, covering their
222da47b [deepseek-v4-flash] #entire life or major portions of it.
222da47b [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Memoir – Also first‑person but focuses on a specific period, theme, or set of experiences
222da47b [deepseek-v4-flash] #rather than the whole life.
222da47c [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Biography – A third‑person account written by someone else, aiming to present a factual,
222da47c [deepseek-v4-flash] #researched portrait of the subject.
222da47c [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Hagiography – A biography that deliberately idealises the subject, often used for saints
222da47c [deepseek-v4-flash] #or revered figures.
222da47d [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Pathography – A biography that emphasises the subject’s flaws, struggles, or illnesses,
222da47d [deepseek-v4-flash] #sometimes seen as a critical reaction to hagiography.
222da47d [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Oral history – A collection of personal recollections, often transcribed from interviews,
222da47d [deepseek-v4-flash] #capturing the lived experience of individuals (sometimes multiple narrators).
222da47e [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Collected letters or diaries – Published primary sources that reveal a person’s life
222da47e [deepseek-v4-flash] #through their own correspondence or daily entries.
222da47e [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Biographical novel – A work of fiction that uses imaginative licence to dramatise and
222da47e [deepseek-v4-flash] #interpret a real person’s life.
222da47f [deepseek-v4-flash] #- Travel memoir – A memoir structured around journeys; the person’s life is revealed
222da47f [deepseek-v4-flash] #through places and encounters.
222da47f [deepseek-v4-flash] #
222da47f [deepseek-v4-flash] #These categories often overlap (e.g., a memoir can be part autobiography) but each has a distinct
222da480 [deepseek-v4-flash] #emphasis on authorship, scope, and intent.
222da480 [deepseek-v4-flash] #
