222dd9bf [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #
222dd9bf [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #This format feels very much like a "manifest" file, which is a great fit for your `biblispec`
222dd9c0 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #architecture. It keeps the data human-readable while remaining easy to parse for any future scripts
