222ddcb1 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #He functioned as a bridge between high-level engineering and public policy. He could explain
222ddcb1 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #complex technical "bugs" in societal systems to a general audience.
222ddcb2 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #• Why it fits: It places him in the tradition of those who curate and translate knowledge
222ddcb2 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #for the public good.
222ddcb2 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #
