2230ebf9 [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #handling string manipulation, but since it relies on `replaceAll` repeatedly, it can be
2230ebfa [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #performance-heavy for large grids. For the `traffic.ts` simulation, using a `Uint8Array` or a
2230ebfa [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #`Uint32Array` buffer to represent the "lane" and rendering that to a string only when needed might
2230ebfa [gemini-3.1-flash-lite] #provide smoother animations.
